  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p>The Bow is a typical hunter's weapon on low-tech worlds, but it is also used for sport on high-tech planets. A primitive Bow and its arrows are made of wood and augmented with metal or stone, while more advanced versions tend to be made from durable, lightweight composite materials. </p><p>The wielder's <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> modifier applies to damage dealt with a Bow. A Bow only holds a single arrow at a time, but can be reloaded as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a>. A quiver of 10 arrows costs 20 credits, and weighs 0.8 kg. </p>",
